### Get exercises in a workout
GET http://localhost:8080/api/workouts/1/exercises
Content-Type: application/json

### Add exercise to workout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/workouts/1/exercises
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exerciseId": 3,
  "orderIndex": 1,
  "notes": "warmup set"
}

### Remove exercise from workout
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/workouts/1/exercises/3
